gn tools.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Most colleges require candidates to have completed 12th grade from a recognized board with a minimum of 45% to 50% marks to apply for degree-level courses such as B.Sc., BCA, or other design-related programs. Some institutes may have slightly different percentage requirements.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>For advanced degree or postgraduate courses, graduation may be required. Although prior coding knowledge is helpful, many degree courses begin with the basics, making them suitable for beginners as well.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also Read:<\/strong> <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/web-development-future\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Web Development Future (Scope and Trends)<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Web Designing Course Fees and Duration&nbsp;<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Web designing course fees and duration vary based on the course type, institute, and learning mode. Below is the detailed overview:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Course Type<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Duration<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Average Fees (INR)<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Online Courses<\/strong><\/td><td>1 \u2013 3 Months<\/td><td>\u20b910,000 \u2013 \u20b930,000<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Diploma Course<\/strong><\/td><td>6 \u2013 12 Months<\/td><td>\u20b930,000 \u2013 \u20b980,000<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Diploma<\/strong><\/td><td>12 \u2013 18 Months<\/td><td>\u20b980,000 \u2013 \u20b91,50,000<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Degree Course<\/strong><\/td><td>3 \u2013 4 Years<\/td><td>\u20b91,00,000 \u2013 \u20b93,00,000+<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong><em>Note<\/em><\/strong><em>: Fees may vary depending on the institute, course curriculum, and certification level.<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Skills Required for a Web Designing Course<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Strong skills in creativity, coding basics, and problem-solving help you succeed in web designing and build professional websites. Below are the essential skills:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Core Technical Skills<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>HTML &amp; CSS Knowledge<\/strong>: Understanding the structure and styling of web pages using HTML and CSS to create well-designed and responsive layouts for modern websites.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Basic JavaScript<\/strong>: Learning JavaScript helps you add interactivity like animations, form validations, and dynamic content to enhance user experience on websites.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Responsive Design<\/strong>: Ability to design websites that work smoothly on mobiles, tablets, and desktops using flexible layouts and media queries.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>UI\/UX Design Principles:<\/strong> Understanding the principles of User Interface (UI) and User Experience (UX) helps create intuitive, user-friendly, and visually appealing website designs.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Design Tools Knowledge<\/strong>: Familiarity with tools like Figma, Adobe XD, or Photoshop to create layouts, wireframes, and prototypes for web pages.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Basic <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO<\/a> Understanding<\/strong>: Knowing the basics helps you design websites optimized for search engines and improve online visibility.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Soft Skills &amp; Foundational Knowledge<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Creativity and Visual Thinking<\/strong>: Ability to think creatively and design unique layouts that attract users and enhance the overall website appearance.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Problem-Solving Skills<\/strong>: Helps you identify issues in design or functionality and find effective solutions during website development.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Attention to Detail<\/strong>: Ensures accuracy in design elements, layouts, spacing, fonts, and coding to create a professional, polished, and visually appealing website.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Communication Skills<\/strong>: Important for understanding client requirements and collaborating with developers, designers, or team members.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Time Management<\/strong>: Helps you complete projects on time, manage multiple tasks efficiently, prioritize design work, and meet client deadlines smoothly in web designing projects.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"container position-relative mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"row pb-4\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-size:32px\">Upcoming Masterclass<\/h2>\n                <p>Attend our live classes led by experienced and desiccated instructors of Wscube Tech.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel myOwl\">\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cracking-meta-google-ads-2026-data-automation-attribution?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T112145_393_1785491880854_775860.webp\" alt=\"Cracking Meta &amp; Google Ads 2026 - Data, Automation &amp; Attribution\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/ai-engineering-roadmap-2026?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T123426_340_1785490284771_211381.webp\" alt=\"AI Engineering Roadmap 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n